[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736351527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4736351527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4736351527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGk79Jw","user":{"login":"PeterD23","id":10536628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTM2NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10536628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23","html_url":"https://github.com/PeterD23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterD23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T23:15:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T23:17:52Z","body":"Created a build from this commit and tried it on my main project, moving nodes around is nearly instantaneous now! Appreciate that absurdly quick turnaround, thank you so much\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f993281f-28c1-4c38-81f8-0916e24f577e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736351527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736462962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4736462962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4736462962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGlCwcg","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T23:39:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T23:39:06Z","body":"Regarding the MRP storage for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120379, the issue with built-in animations is resolved by simple bool flag, but since the same problem exists for saved animations, I am currently working on whether any write speed improvements can be implemented.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736462962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736612204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4736612204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4736612204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGlL3bA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T00:06:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T00:06:32Z","body":"For now, the built-in resource animation issue has been completely resolved.\r\n\r\nRegarding non-built-in resource animations, I cannot determine on my own what the optimal way to manage folding is, so I have multi-threaded only the part that performs multiple file writes simultaneously. Then, on my PC, I am now able to avoid the white-out freezing, but it might still white out on PCs with fewer threads.\r\n\r\nIf possible, it would be ideal to stop storing folding information within the animation itself and instead have one dictionary per project. Alternatively, a compromise might be to manage it per AnimationLibrary.\r\n\r\n@Meorge If that can be done safely and quickly, I don't mind if you salvage this PR as superseded. If it looks like it will take time, we should probably do that in 4.8 or as a 4.7.1 cherry-pick.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736612204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736686005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4736686005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4736686005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGlQXtQ","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T00:19:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T00:21:31Z","body":"And I added the folding_changed flag. So while the case for all animations are using the folding might still be heavy, but the issue should no longer occur in most cases where the most of animations do not use folding.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736686005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738228737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4738228737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4738228737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGmuiAQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T05:09:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T05:09:13Z","body":"> If possible, it would be ideal to stop storing folding information within the animation itself and instead have one dictionary per project. Alternatively, a compromise might be to manage it per AnimationLibrary.\r\n\r\nMy experience with Godot's animation systems has been relatively limited, but my concern with the AnimationLibrary approach is that I _think_ a single Animation resource could be referenced by multiple AnimationLibrary resources? If so, then an Animation's fold state could not be determined without the AnimationLibrary, which complicates things.\r\n\r\nIn general, as far as I can tell the engine stores fold data per-resource for other types of resources, so it generally makes sense to me that animation resources would work the same way.\r\n\r\n> If that can be done safely and quickly, I don't mind if you salvage this PR as superseded. If it looks like it will take time, we should probably do that in 4.8 or as a 4.7.1 cherry-pick.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately I don't think I'll be able to figure this all out in a short period of time (especially as 4.7 is just around the corner). My opinion on how to handle this would probably overall be:\r\n- Merge this PR ASAP so that the poor user experience of having the editor freeze up is mitigated as much as possible.\r\n- Introduce a setting soon to enable/disable animation group collapsing. If the setting is disabled, then the fold buttons on animation groups disappear and fold data is not saved (the old behavior). Users who have projects with many external animation resources can disable folding to keep performance reasonable. This should be easier to implement than a new approach to saving fold data, and as such could be added sooner in 4.7.1.\r\n- Discuss and then implement a more robust solution that potentially changes the structure of the fold data. This could be added in 4.8, or potentially in a 4.7.x version.\r\n\r\nIt is possible that I'm massively overthinking how difficult it would be to implement a different structure for animation fold data, like a single dictionary for the whole project... it is quite late for me now and when I'm tired I do tend to exaggerate the difficulty of things 😅. In the coming days I'll put it on my to-do list to look into this approach, but I don't expect to have much for at least a week or so due to other things going on. So, merging this PR for now if it solves the problem for built-in animations still seems to me like it'd be a good idea.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738228737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741617659","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4741617659","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4741617659,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGp9X-w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T11:46:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T11:55:56Z","body":"I tested the MRP and the problem is that editor tries to save folding for every single animation in the scene, and since they all belong to the same scene, it just keeps writing the same file over and over. The editor should identify that all animations belong to the same scene and save the folding only once. Does this PR handle it?\r\nEDIT:\r\nAfter reading the code more thoroughly, yeah, it does.\r\n\r\nAs for external animations, the issue seems to happen when there are hundreds of animations involved. Is this a realistic scenario where each of these animations is a separate file?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741617659/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744433540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120384#issuecomment-4744433540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120384","id":4744433540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGspPhA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T17:17:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T17:17:13Z","body":"Superseded by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744433540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perform